{
  "id": "0115-big-craftables-d",
  "kind": "short",
  "records": [
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"RedCanes_Description","source":"A decorative piece for your farm.","translation":"一件裝飾農場的擺設。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"RitualMask_Name","source":"Ritual Mask","translation":"儀式面具"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"RitualMask_Description","source":"It's way too large to wear.","translation":"大得根本無法戴上。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"Scarecrow_Name","source":"Scarecrow","translation":"稻草人"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"Scarecrow_Description","source":"Prevents crows from attacking your crops. Has a limited radius (about 8 \"tiles\").","translation":"防止烏鴉啄食作物。作用範圍有限（半徑約 8「格」）。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeasonalDecor_Name","source":"Seasonal Decor","translation":"季節裝飾"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeasonalDecor_Description","source":"This decoration changes with the seasons.","translation":"這件裝飾會隨季節變化。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeasonalPlant_Name","source":"Seasonal Plant","translation":"季節盆栽"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeasonalPlant_Description","source":"An ornamental plant that changes with each season. It doesn't need to be watered.","translation":"會隨每個季節變化的觀賞植物。無須澆水。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeedMaker_Name","source":"Seed Maker","translation":"種子製造機"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SeedMaker_Description","source":"Place crops inside to produce a varying amount of seeds. Doesn't work with fruit tree crops.","translation":"放入作物以產出數量不等的種子。不適用於果樹作物。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SewingMachine_Name","source":"Sewing Machine","translation":"縫紉機"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SewingMachine_Description","source":"Use to tailor clothes from the convenience of your home!","translation":"在家就能方便地裁製衣服！"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SignOfTheVessel_Name","source":"Sign Of The Vessel","translation":"容器之印"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SignOfTheVessel_Description","source":"A decorative piece for your farm.","translation":"一件裝飾農場的擺設。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SingingStone_Name","source":"Singing Stone","translation":"歌唱石"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SingingStone_Description","source":"It rings out with a pure tone when struck.","translation":"敲擊時會發出純淨音色。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SkeletonModel_Name","source":"Skeleton Model","translation":"骨骼模型"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SkeletonModel_Description","source":"A model of a skeleton.","translation":"一具骨骼模型。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SkullBrazier_Name","source":"Skull Brazier","translation":"骷髏火盆"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SkullBrazier_Description","source":"Provides a moderate amount of light.","translation":"提供適量光線。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeBall_Name","source":"Slime Ball","translation":"史萊姆球"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeBall_Description","source":"Filled with slime.","translation":"裡面充滿黏液。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeEggPress_Name","source":"Slime Egg-Press","translation":"史萊姆蛋壓製機"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeEggPress_Description","source":"Compresses 100 pieces of slime into a slime egg. It's a miracle of science!","translation":"將 100 份黏液壓製成一顆史萊姆蛋。這是科學的奇蹟！"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeIncubator_Name","source":"Slime Incubator","translation":"史萊姆孵化器"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlimeIncubator_Description","source":"Hatches slimes eggs into slimes. Allows you to raise slimes outdoors.","translation":"將史萊姆蛋孵化成史萊姆。讓你能在戶外飼養史萊姆。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonL_Name","source":"Sloth Skeleton L","translation":"樹懶骨架（左）"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonL_Description","source":"This extinct sloth roamed the lush, prehistoric forests of Stardew Valley. Its powerful jaw tore through the toughest plant fibers.","translation":"這種已滅絕的樹懶曾漫遊於星露谷蓊鬱的史前森林。牠強而有力的下顎能撕碎最堅韌的植物纖維。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonM_Name","source":"Sloth Skeleton M","translation":"樹懶骨架（中）"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonM_Description","source":"The ribs of a prehistoric sloth. ","translation":"史前樹懶的肋骨。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonR_Name","source":"Sloth Skeleton R","translation":"樹懶骨架（右）"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SlothSkeletonR_Description","source":"The hind legs and tail of a prehistoric sloth.","translation":"史前樹懶的後腿和尾巴。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SodaMachine_Name","source":"Soda Machine","translation":"汽水機"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SodaMachine_Description","source":"Keeps pumping out the good stuff.","translation":"源源不絕地供應好東西。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SolarPanel_Name","source":"Solar Panel","translation":"太陽能板"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SolarPanel_Description","source":"Slowly generates batteries when left in the sun.","translation":"放在陽光下時會緩慢產生電池組。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SolidGoldLewis_Name","source":"Solid Gold Lewis","translation":"純金路易斯像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SolidGoldLewis_Description","source":"Mayor's secret project.","translation":"鎮長的祕密計畫。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"Staircase_Name","source":"Staircase","translation":"樓梯"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"Staircase_Description","source":"Use this to move down a level in the mines.","translation":"用它在礦井中向下一層。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StandingGeode_Name","source":"Standing Geode","translation":"立式晶球"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StandingGeode_Description","source":"It's a huge geode mounted on a stand. Hundreds of purple crystals shimmer within.","translation":"架在底座上的巨大晶球。內部有數百顆紫色水晶閃閃發光。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StardewHeroTrophy_Name","source":"Stardew Hero Trophy","translation":"星露谷英雄獎盃"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StardewHeroTrophy_Description","source":"The most prestigious award a Stardew Valley resident could receive!","translation":"星露谷居民所能獲得的最高榮譽！"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfBlessings_Name","source":"Statue Of Blessings","translation":"祝福雕像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfBlessings_Description","source":"Touching the statue gives a unique blessing every day.","translation":"每天觸摸雕像都會獲得一種獨特祝福。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfEndlessFortune_Name","source":"Statue Of Endless Fortune","translation":"無盡財富雕像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfEndlessFortune_Description","source":"It's made of solid gold. What's it for?","translation":"以純金製成。它有什麼用途？"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfPerfection_Name","source":"Statue Of Perfection","translation":"完美雕像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfPerfection_Description","source":"It's made of pure iridium.","translation":"以純銥製成。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfTheDwarfKing_Name","source":"Statue Of The Dwarf King","translation":"矮人王雕像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfTheDwarfKing_Description","source":"Choose from two mining-related powers each day.","translation":"每天可從兩種採礦相關能力中擇一。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfTruePerfection_Name","source":"Statue Of True Perfection","translation":"真正完美雕像"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StatueOfTruePerfection_Description","source":"It's made of pure iridium.","translation":"以純銥製成。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneBrazier_Name","source":"Stone Brazier","translation":"石製火盆"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneBrazier_Description","source":"Provides a moderate amount of light.","translation":"提供適量光線。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneCairn_Name","source":"Stone Cairn","translation":"石堆"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneCairn_Description","source":"A decorative piece for your farm.","translation":"一件裝飾農場的擺設。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneChest_Name","source":"Stone Chest","translation":"石箱"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneChest_Description","source":"A place to store your items.","translation":"用來存放物品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneFrog_Name","source":"Stone Frog","translation":"石蛙"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneFrog_Description","source":"Garden art for your farm.","translation":"裝飾農場的庭園藝術品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneJunimo_Name","source":"Stone Junimo","translation":"石製祝尼魔"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneJunimo_Description","source":"Garden art for your farm.","translation":"裝飾農場的庭園藝術品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneOwl_Decorative_Name","source":"Stone Owl","translation":"石貓頭鷹"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneOwl_Decorative_Description","source":"Garden art for your farm.","translation":"裝飾農場的庭園藝術品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneOwl_Secret_Name","source":"Stone Owl","translation":"石貓頭鷹"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneOwl_Secret_Description","source":"It's not clear where this came from, but it looks very fine.","translation":"不清楚它從何而來，但看起來十分精緻。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneParrot_Name","source":"Stone Parrot","translation":"石鸚鵡"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneParrot_Description","source":"Garden art for your farm.","translation":"裝飾農場的庭園藝術品。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneSign_Name","source":"Stone Sign","translation":"石製標牌"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StoneSign_Description","source":"Use an item on this to change what's displayed. The item won't be consumed.","translation":"對它使用物品即可更改展示內容。物品不會被消耗。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StrangeCapsule_Name","source":"Strange Capsule","translation":"奇怪膠囊"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StrangeCapsule_Description","source":"There's something fleshy bobbing around in the fluid...","translation":"液體中有某種肉質的東西上下漂浮……"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StumpBrazier_Name","source":"Stump Brazier","translation":"樹樁火盆"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"StumpBrazier_Description","source":"Provides a moderate amount of light.","translation":"提供適量光線。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SuitOfArmor_Name","source":"Suit Of Armor","translation":"全身盔甲"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"SuitOfArmor_Description","source":"A decorative piece for your farm.","translation":"一件裝飾農場的擺設。"},
    {"target":"Strings/BigCraftables","key":"TablePieceL_Name","source":"Table Piece L","translation":"桌子部件 L"}
  ]
